{"number":87,"name":"سُورَةُ الأَعۡلَىٰ","englishName":"Al-A'laa","englishNameTranslation":"The Most High","numberOfAyahs":19,"items":[{"id":"q:87:1","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":87,"ayah":1,"surahName":"Al-A'laa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ سَبِّحِ ٱسْمَ رَبِّكَ ٱلْأَعْلَى","en":"Exalt the name of your Lord, the Most High,","bn":"আপনি আপনার মহান পালনকর্তার নামের পবিত্রতা বর্ণনা করুন","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/87/1"},{"id":"q:87:2","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":87,"ayah":2,"surahName":"Al-A'laa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ فَسَوَّىٰ","en":"Who created and proportioned","bn":"যিনি সৃষ্টি করেছেন ও সুবিন্যস্ত করেছেন।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/87/2"},{"id":"q:87:3","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":87,"ayah":3,"surahName":"Al-A'laa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَٱلَّذِى قَدَّرَ فَهَدَىٰ","en":"And who destined and [then] guided","bn":"এবং যিনি সুপরিমিত করেছেন ও পথ প্রদর্শন করেছেন","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/87/3"},{"id":"q:87:4","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":87,"ayah":4,"surahName":"Al-A'laa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَٱلَّذِىٓ أَخْرَجَ ٱلْمَرْعَىٰ","en":"And who brings out the pasture","bn":"এবং যিনি তৃণাদি উৎপন্ন করেছেন,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/87/4"},{"id":"q:87:5","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":87,"ayah":5,"surahName":"Al-A'laa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فَجَعَلَهُۥ غُثَآءً أَحْوَىٰ","en":"And [then] makes it black stubble.","bn":"অতঃপর করেছেন তাকে কাল আবর্জনা।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/87/5"},{"id":"q:87:6","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":87,"ayah":6,"surahName":"Al-A'laa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"سَنُقْرِئُكَ فَلَا تَنسَىٰٓ","en":"We will make you recite, [O Muhammad], and you will not forget,","bn":"আমি আপনাকে পাঠ করাতে থাকব, ফলে আপনি বিস্মৃত হবেন না","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/87/6"},{"id":"q:87:7","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":87,"ayah":7,"surahName":"Al-A'laa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"إِلَّا مَا شَآءَ ٱللَّهُ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ يَعْلَمُ ٱلْجَهْرَ وَمَا يَخْفَىٰ","en":"Except what Allah should will. Indeed, He knows what is declared and what is hidden.","bn":"আল্লাহ যা ইচ্ছা করেন তা ব্যতীত। নিশ্চয় তিনি জানেন প্রকাশ্য ও গোপন বিষয়।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/87/7"},{"id":"q:87:8","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":87,"ayah":8,"surahName":"Al-A'laa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَنُيَسِّرُكَ لِلْيُسْرَىٰ","en":"And We will ease you toward ease.","bn":"আমি আপনার জন্যে সহজ শরীয়ত সহজতর করে দেবো।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/87/8"},{"id":"q:87:9","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":87,"ayah":9,"surahName":"Al-A'laa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فَذَكِّرْ إِن نَّفَعَتِ ٱلذِّكْرَىٰ","en":"So remind, if the reminder should benefit;","bn":"উপদেশ ফলপ্রসূ হলে উপদেশ দান করুন,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/87/9"},{"id":"q:87:10","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":87,"ayah":10,"surahName":"Al-A'laa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"سَيَذَّكَّرُ مَن يَخْشَىٰ","en":"He who fears [Allah] will be reminded.","bn":"যে ভয় করে, সে উপদেশ গ্রহণ করবে,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/87/10"},{"id":"q:87:11","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":87,"ayah":11,"surahName":"Al-A'laa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَيَتَجَنَّبُهَا ٱلْأَشْقَى","en":"But the wretched one will avoid it -","bn":"আর যে, হতভাগা, সে তা উপেক্ষা করবে,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/87/11"},{"id":"q:87:12","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":87,"ayah":12,"surahName":"Al-A'laa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"ٱلَّذِى يَصْلَى ٱلنَّارَ ٱلْكُبْرَىٰ","en":"[He] who will [enter and] burn in the greatest Fire,","bn":"সে মহা-অগ্নিতে প্রবেশ করবে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/87/12"},{"id":"q:87:13","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":87,"ayah":13,"surahName":"Al-A'laa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"ثُمَّ لَا يَمُوتُ فِيهَا وَلَا يَحْيَىٰ","en":"Neither dying therein nor living.","bn":"অতঃপর সেখানে সে মরবেও না, জীবিতও থাকবে না।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/87/13"},{"id":"q:87:14","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":87,"ayah":14,"surahName":"Al-A'laa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"قَدْ أَفْلَحَ مَن تَزَكَّىٰ","en":"He has certainly succeeded who purifies himself","bn":"নিশ্চয় সাফল্য লাভ করবে সে, যে শুদ্ধ হয়","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/87/14"},{"id":"q:87:15","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":87,"ayah":15,"surahName":"Al-A'laa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَذَكَرَ ٱسْمَ رَبِّهِۦ فَصَلَّىٰ","en":"And mentions the name of his Lord and prays.","bn":"এবং তার পালনকর্তার নাম স্মরণ করে, অতঃপর নামায আদায় করে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/87/15"},{"id":"q:87:16","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":87,"ayah":16,"surahName":"Al-A'laa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"بَلْ تُؤْثِرُونَ ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ ٱلدُّنْيَا","en":"But you prefer the worldly life,","bn":"বস্তুতঃ তোমরা পার্থিব জীবনকে অগ্রাধিকার দাও,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/87/16"},{"id":"q:87:17","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":87,"ayah":17,"surahName":"Al-A'laa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَٱلْءَاخِرَةُ خَيْرٌۭ وَأَبْقَىٰٓ","en":"While the Hereafter is better and more enduring.","bn":"অথচ পরকালের জীবন উৎকৃষ্ট ও স্থায়ী।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/87/17"},{"id":"q:87:18","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":87,"ayah":18,"surahName":"Al-A'laa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"إِنَّ هَٰذَا لَفِى ٱلصُّحُفِ ٱلْأُولَىٰ","en":"Indeed, this is in the former scriptures,","bn":"এটা লিখিত রয়েছে পূর্ববতী কিতাবসমূহে;","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/87/18"},{"id":"q:87:19","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":87,"ayah":19,"surahName":"Al-A'laa","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"صُحُفِ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ وَمُوسَىٰ","en":"The scriptures of Abraham and Moses.","bn":"ইব্রাহীম ও মূসার কিতাবসমূহে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/87/19"}]}